/ActualText (For example, when you combine the number 5 with the string '10' using the addition operator, the result is the string '510'. This occurs because JavaScript will implicitly convert the number 5 to a string following the priority of coercion, and then concatenate it to the string '10'.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
>>
