/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewers for JavaScript will often look to assess your code debugging skills. Practice using IDEs or browser developer tools to find and correct common JavaScript code issues. Learn how to read error messages and review basic debugging techniques.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
